Package: screencopy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Matej Jazbinšek <17124651+sinkec@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/sinkec/ScreenCopy
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.24), gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav, network-manager, iptables, pkexec, pulseaudio-utils, librsvg2-common
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly
Description: Mirror one monitor to a TV over Miracast
 ScreenCopy clones one selected monitor to a Miracast TV, with sound, on an
 X11 desktop. It runs without root privileges. A small helper opens the
 firewall only on the Wi-Fi Direct connection and only during a session.
 There is no telemetry.
